<title>POLAND: Paged plans no dividend for 1996.</title>
<headline>Paged plans no dividend for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish wood trader Paged SA plans to pay no dividend for 1996 and to put 9.7 million zlotys of its 10.1-million-zloty net profit into reserve capital, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Paged said the rest would go to a social fund for employees. Shareholders vote on the measure on June 26.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
